                    "text": [
                      "\\007\\2!S2!!F:8ed435d9-51cb-44e7-8b0d-ca85e63ca427!I had to do it.",
                      "\\007\\2!S2!!F:8ed435d9-51cb-44e7-8b0d-ca85e63ca427!I have my motives,!S5! !S2!Lila.",
                      "\\007\\2!S2!!F:8ed435d9-51cb-44e7-8b0d-ca85e63ca427!You will never\nunderstand them.",
                      "\\007\\2!S2!!F:8ed435d9-51cb-44e7-8b0d-ca85e63ca427!Every resource my\nteam needed,",
                      "\\007\\2!S2!!F:8ed435d9-51cb-44e7-8b0d-ca85e63ca427!is in this very ship."
